WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.016
News today. A video engine grafted on spatial attention.

00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:14.016
The eye that knows where everything is. A hundred shots, the face never changes.

00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:18.026
But where does it run?

00:00:18.026 --> 00:00:22.801
The GPUs are mine. Billed per frame!

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:28.031
It is open weights. You can just download it, no?

00:00:28.031 --> 00:00:32.041
Download, sure... but where does it run?

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:34.708
Right here. Our GPUs.

00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:40.041
Only his invoice blurs.

